{"model": "small.en-greedy", "slug": "C_S03E03", "language": "en", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.0, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 2.0, "end": 6.0, "text": "Ah, I really mean my bones with that last collar, babe."}, {"start": 6.0, "end": 7.0, "text": "Today's the day."}, {"start": 7.0, "end": 9.0, "text": "You woke up at the guard this morning,"}, {"start": 9.0, "end": 13.0, "text": "but tonight, you're going to bed with a detective."}, {"start": 13.0, "end": 15.0, "text": "Shh."}, {"start": 15.0, "end": 17.0, "text": "Okay, you get some rest."}, {"start": 17.0, "end": 19.0, "text": "Okay?"}, {"start": 19.0, "end": 21.0, "text": "Probably need it."}, {"start": 21.0, "end": 24.0, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 24.0, "end": 27.0, "text": "[ Grunts ]"}, {"start": 27.0, "end": 29.92, "text": "(guitar strumming)"}, {"start": 31.36, "end": 33.36, "text": "- There's Ben dressed like a dragon."}, {"start": 33.36, "end": 34.5, "text": "- Aw."}, {"start": 34.5, "end": 36.94, "text": "- Here's me and Abbe dressed as Nick Nolte and Eddie Murphy."}, {"start": 36.94, "end": 38.44, "text": "- Aw."}, {"start": 38.44, "end": 39.84, "text": "- Who's Nick Nolte?"}, {"start": 39.84, "end": 41.38, "text": "- Aw."}, {"start": 41.38, "end": 44.48, "text": "- Hey, Abe, can I borrow some change for the water fountain?"}, {"start": 44.48, "end": 45.32, "text": "- Here you go."}, {"start": 45.32, "end": 46.82, "text": "- Make some change?"}, {"start": 49.02, "end": 51.72, "text": "- Pateen, what are you doing?"}, {"start": 51.72, "end": 54.46, "text": "- Nothing after lunch, and I can skip lunch if you want."}, {"start": 54.46, "end": 55.46, "text": "- Oh, that."}, {"start": 56.62, "end": 58.62, "text": "- It's a two-wish and down, and it saves on water, too."}, {"start": 58.62, "end": 60.62, "text": "- That's because nobody's gonna pay to drink water."}, {"start": 60.62, "end": 62.42, "text": "- Actually, it's a two-drink minimum."}, {"start": 62.42, "end": 64.12, "text": "It'll be reflected in your tuition."}, {"start": 64.12, "end": 67.12, "text": "- Hey, Dean, thanks for the new digs."}, {"start": 67.12, "end": 68.92, "text": "Remember what we talked about."}, {"start": 68.92, "end": 71.92, "text": "We have to keep this whole living situation kind of quiet,"}, {"start": 71.92, "end": 73.72, "text": "you know, on the Dean low."}, {"start": 73.72, "end": 75.62, "text": "- Sure, I'm barely there."}, {"start": 75.62, "end": 77.32, "text": "I'm married to the job."}, {"start": 77.32, "end": 79.92, "text": "- And to a mannequin like I found in the boiler room."}, {"start": 79.92, "end": 81.72, "text": "- Home wrecker."}, {"start": 81.72, "end": 84.62, "text": "- Your first major lab assignment is to construct a terrarium."}, {"start": 84.62, "end": 85.92, "text": "Sort of like a diorama."}, {"start": 85.92, "end": 88.12, "text": "[GROANING]"}, {"start": 88.12, "end": 91.72, "text": "You guys have weird reactions to stuff."}, {"start": 91.72, "end": 93.32, "text": "Hey, can I ask you something?"}, {"start": 93.32, "end": 95.12, "text": "This is unrelated."}, {"start": 95.12, "end": 96.36, "text": "As someone who just finished spending"}, {"start": 96.36, "end": 98.8, "text": "the majority of his life in prison, what happened with Legos?"}, {"start": 98.8, "end": 101.72, "text": "They used to be simple."}, {"start": 101.72, "end": 102.62, "text": "Now, come on."}, {"start": 102.62, "end": 103.92, "text": "I know you know what I'm talking about."}, {"start": 103.92, "end": 104.92, "text": "Legos were simple."}, {"start": 108.84, "end": 112.12, "text": "Something happened out here while I was inside."}, {"start": 112.12, "end": 116.44, "text": "Harry Potter Legos, Star Wars Legos, complicated kits,"}, {"start": 116.44, "end": 119.36, "text": "tiny little blocks."}, {"start": 119.36, "end": 120.32, "text": "I mean, let's say it's bad."}, {"start": 120.32, "end": 121.44, "text": "I just want to know what happened."}, {"start": 123.92, "end": 124.8, "text": "All right, fine."}, {"start": 124.8, "end": 126.76, "text": "Your terrariums will do tomorrow."}, {"start": 126.76, "end": 128.48, "text": "And everyone, look across the table"}, {"start": 128.48, "end": 130.48, "text": "at the person in front of you."}, {"start": 130.48, "end": 133.4, "text": "That's your lab partner for the rest of the semester."}, {"start": 133.4, "end": 136.32, "text": "Saddle up."}, {"start": 136.32, "end": 139.12, "text": "Who are these people?"}, {"start": 139.12, "end": 142.36, "text": "# Give me some more time and dream"}, {"start": 142.36, "end": 145.56, "text": "# Give me the hope to run out of steam"}, {"start": 145.56, "end": 147.52, "text": "# Somebody say"}, {"start": 147.52, "end": 149.12, "text": "# We could be here"}, {"start": 149.12, "end": 152.88, "text": "# We could be rowing sometimes I'd better get it"}, {"start": 152.88, "end": 157.88, "text": "# I can't count the reasons I should stay"}, {"start": 157.88, "end": 162.16, "text": "# Walk by one, they all just fade away"}, {"start": 165.36, "end": 168.84, "text": "Um, hello, please, Professor Kane."}, {"start": 168.84, "end": 169.84, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 169.84, "end": 174.56, "text": "I know you haven't been here at Greendale very long, but, um, we're a study group."}, {"start": 174.56, "end": 176.48, "text": "That's kind of a thing. We've been through a lot."}, {"start": 176.48, "end": 177.84, "text": "You've probably heard of the space bus."}, {"start": 177.84, "end": 178.44, "text": "Paintball."}, {"start": 178.44, "end": 182.64, "text": "I had sex with her as the kid in an airplane bathroom, and these are the only guys I've ever told her."}, {"start": 182.64, "end": 184.84, "text": "Yeah, we're like a family. We love each other."}, {"start": 184.84, "end": 185.64, "text": "Second paintball."}, {"start": 185.64, "end": 189.94, "text": "What is happening at the school? I have so many conversations that make no sense."}, {"start": 189.94, "end": 192.84, "text": "We'd really prefer to partner up amongst ourselves."}, {"start": 192.84, "end": 193.44, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 194.64, "end": 195.54, "text": "I don't care. Go ahead."}, {"start": 195.54, "end": 196.84, "text": "Oh, I can't."}, {"start": 196.84, "end": 198.24, "text": "Oh, great. You did not regret this."}, {"start": 198.24, "end": 199.84, "text": "It's not you, it's me."}, {"start": 199.84, "end": 202.84, "text": "But I'm just trying to protect us both from more pain down the road."}, {"start": 202.84, "end": 204.34, "text": "I may have a developmental disorder."}, {"start": 204.34, "end": 207.04, "text": "I need to catch up on Breaking Bad, so..."}, {"start": 207.04, "end": 208.54, "text": "I'm so sorry."}, {"start": 208.54, "end": 210.34, "text": "I have a developmental disorder."}, {"start": 210.34, "end": 212.34, "text": "Star Wars, Star Wars, cool, cool, cool."}, {"start": 212.34, "end": 213.14, "text": "You understand?"}, {"start": 213.14, "end": 216.14, "text": "You're also, quite frankly, a very weird-looking man."}, {"start": 216.14, "end": 219.24, "text": "I don't know you, but I just don't trust you,"}, {"start": 219.24, "end": 221.14, "text": "and I don't think I could grow to like you."}, {"start": 221.14, "end": 222.64, "text": "The point of what I'm trying to tell you, Todd,"}, {"start": 222.64, "end": 224.54, "text": "is that I don't want to be your lab partner."}, {"start": 224.54, "end": 225.24, "text": "No offense."}, {"start": 225.24, "end": 226.24, "text": "None taken."}, {"start": 226.24, "end": 228.44, "text": "I understand. You want to be with your friends."}, {"start": 228.44, "end": 231.04, "text": "Don't tell me what I'm feeling or thinking. It's petty."}, {"start": 231.04, "end": 232.04, "text": "Goodbye, Todd."}, {"start": 233.38, "end": 236.04, "text": "Okay, how are we gonna divide the..."}, {"start": 238.38, "end": 240.14, "text": "Hey, Todd, Todd, buddy!"}, {"start": 240.14, "end": 241.64, "text": "You pass the test!"}, {"start": 243.94, "end": 246.24, "text": "I've been walking my beat a long time, sir."}, {"start": 246.24, "end": 247.64, "text": "A long time."}, {"start": 247.64, "end": 250.34, "text": "I've kept my head down, paid my dues, and..."}, {"start": 250.34, "end": 252.14, "text": "Well, I think I'm ready to make detective."}, {"start": 252.14, "end": 253.74, "text": "You've only been here a month."}, {"start": 253.74, "end": 255.64, "text": "You really haven't done much of anything."}, {"start": 255.64, "end": 258.8, "text": "and there's no such thing as security guard detective."}, {"start": 258.8, "end": 261.02, "text": "We don't solve crimes."}, {"start": 261.02, "end": 262.98, "text": "We barely prevent them."}, {"start": 262.98, "end": 264.4, "text": "You wanna detect something?"}, {"start": 266.02, "end": 267.2, "text": "Do it on your own time."}, {"start": 270.36, "end": 271.36, "text": "- Maybe I will."}, {"start": 272.36, "end": 274.28, "text": "Maybe I will."}, {"start": 275.16, "end": 279.46, "text": "My own words rang in my head like a bell inside a head."}, {"start": 279.46, "end": 280.96, "text": "Maybe I was crazy."}, {"start": 280.96, "end": 284.92, "text": "Or maybe, just maybe, I was a detective."}, {"start": 285.64, "end": 287.64, "text": "Hey."}, {"start": 287.64, "end": 288.64, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 288.64, "end": 289.64, "text": "Looking for something?"}, {"start": 289.64, "end": 291.64, "text": "No."}, {"start": 291.64, "end": 293.64, "text": "She said she wasn't, but her eyes said otherwise."}, {"start": 293.64, "end": 294.64, "text": "She was all dame."}, {"start": 294.64, "end": 297.64, "text": "Legs that went all the way to the bottom of her torso."}, {"start": 297.64, "end": 299.64, "text": "The kind of arms that had elbows."}, {"start": 299.64, "end": 303.64, "text": "Um... did you just call me in here to stare at me?"}, {"start": 309.64, "end": 313.64, "text": "The way she left, I could tell that somebody, or something,"}, {"start": 313.64, "end": 315.64, "text": "had really put the scare on her."}, {"start": 315.64, "end": 317.64, "text": "But what? Why?"}, {"start": 317.64, "end": 319.14, "text": "Stapler."}, {"start": 319.14, "end": 320.64, "text": "Was it crazy?"}, {"start": 320.64, "end": 322.64, "text": "Or were they somehow connected?"}, {"start": 323.64, "end": 324.64, "text": "I can't believe it!"}, {"start": 324.64, "end": 327.14, "text": "This is the first time there hasn't been a beetle in here."}, {"start": 327.14, "end": 328.64, "text": "Should we move outside?"}, {"start": 328.64, "end": 330.14, "text": "Uh-huh."}, {"start": 330.14, "end": 331.64, "text": "Did you even hear what I said?"}, {"start": 331.64, "end": 332.64, "text": "Uh-huh."}, {"start": 332.64, "end": 333.64, "text": "Seriously?"}, {"start": 333.64, "end": 335.64, "text": "Is this what it's gonna be like working together?"}, {"start": 335.64, "end": 336.64, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 336.64, "end": 338.64, "text": "It was three followers."}, {"start": 338.64, "end": 342.64, "text": "People just can't have a little truth about Ben Sherman's winter collection."}, {"start": 343.64, "end": 344.48, "text": "- Yeah."}, {"start": 344.48, "end": 345.3, "text": "- Yeah."}, {"start": 345.3, "end": 348.3, "text": "- Roommates, study group, lab partners."}, {"start": 348.3, "end": 349.92, "text": "We really are gonna spend all our time together."}, {"start": 349.92, "end": 351.02, "text": "How awesome is that?"}, {"start": 351.02, "end": 352.5, "text": "- Mary, you know what else is awesome?"}, {"start": 352.5, "end": 353.76, "text": "Last night I saw the Hong Kong movie"}, {"start": 353.76, "end": 354.96, "text": "that Kick Puncher is based on."}, {"start": 354.96, "end": 356.74, "text": "- Yeah, I know, I was there."}, {"start": 356.74, "end": 357.76, "text": "- Did you see the scene where Kick Puncher"}, {"start": 357.76, "end": 359.62, "text": "Kick Puncher's 200 guys with one kick punch?"}, {"start": 359.62, "end": 361.2, "text": "- Yeah, both of them."}, {"start": 363.64, "end": 365.2, "text": "- Oh."}, {"start": 365.2, "end": 366.86, "text": "- We spent too much time together."}, {"start": 367.86, "end": 369.12, "text": "- Thanks."}, {"start": 369.12, "end": 370.68, "text": "- Here's Ben with his cupcake."}, {"start": 371.88, "end": 373.12, "text": "And here he is a few seconds later"}, {"start": 373.12, "end": 374.96, "text": "when he was crying because he dropped his cupcake."}, {"start": 374.96, "end": 376.12, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 376.12, "end": 378.0, "text": "And here he is with another cupcake."}, {"start": 378.0, "end": 379.36, "text": "Oh wait, these pictures are all yours,"}, {"start": 379.36, "end": 380.2, "text": "it's the same cupcake."}, {"start": 380.2, "end": 383.04, "text": "- Oh Shirley, these pictures are adorable"}, {"start": 383.04, "end": 385.28, "text": "and comprehensive, but did you know"}, {"start": 385.28, "end": 387.24, "text": "that sugar is like baby meth?"}, {"start": 387.24, "end": 388.72, "text": "That's what my homeopath said."}, {"start": 388.72, "end": 391.52, "text": "- Well maybe your gay friend should mind his own business."}, {"start": 394.72, "end": 396.72, "text": "- Forget about the girl I told myself."}, {"start": 396.72, "end": 398.96, "text": "Let her go, like a lobster claw,"}, {"start": 398.96, "end": 402.28, "text": "letting go of a small balloon for lobsters."}, {"start": 402.28, "end": 404.68, "text": "Still, I had a hunch."}, {"start": 404.68, "end": 405.52, "text": "Hmm."}, {"start": 406.48, "end": 407.84, "text": "Matchbook."}, {"start": 407.84, "end": 410.28, "text": "Something about it seemed clue-y."}, {"start": 410.28, "end": 413.06, "text": "Arizona Matchbook Company."}, {"start": 413.06, "end": 414.6, "text": "Arizona."}, {"start": 414.6, "end": 417.88, "text": "Arizona backwards is still Arizona."}, {"start": 417.88, "end": 419.24, "text": "It's a palomino."}, {"start": 419.24, "end": 423.52, "text": "Maybe I was crazy, or maybe I was finally sane."}, {"start": 426.24, "end": 428.08, "text": "Why does this guy keep staring at me?"}, {"start": 429.64, "end": 432.64, "text": "(crickets chirping)"}, {"start": 433.98, "end": 435.88, "text": "- Britta, what are you doing here?"}, {"start": 435.88, "end": 437.52, "text": "- Oh, I was just getting some air."}, {"start": 437.52, "end": 440.06, "text": "- Me too, and wondering something."}, {"start": 440.06, "end": 441.52, "text": "- I was wondering something too."}, {"start": 441.52, "end": 442.36, "text": "- Tell me."}, {"start": 442.36, "end": 443.48, "text": "- No, you first."}, {"start": 443.48, "end": 444.9, "text": "I was wondering what would it be like"}, {"start": 444.9, "end": 446.06, "text": "if we were partners."}, {"start": 446.06, "end": 447.5, "text": "- What's going on here?"}, {"start": 447.5, "end": 449.12, "text": "- Were you thinking of changing partners?"}, {"start": 449.12, "end": 450.62, "text": "- I was thinking of changing partners."}, {"start": 450.62, "end": 451.5, "text": "- Were you gonna bail on me?"}, {"start": 451.5, "end": 454.26, "text": "- No, no one here is thinking of changing partners."}, {"start": 454.26, "end": 455.14, "text": "No, sir."}, {"start": 455.14, "end": 456.2, "text": "- I am."}, {"start": 456.2, "end": 459.48, "text": "While he was spying, I found a turtle."}, {"start": 459.48, "end": 462.64, "text": "It's not fair that I should be the only one here saddled"}, {"start": 462.64, "end": 465.04, "text": "with a total waste of space loser."}, {"start": 465.04, "end": 466.24, "text": "No offense, Todd."}, {"start": 466.24, "end": 467.32, "text": "None taken."}, {"start": 467.32, "end": 470.24, "text": "Why should you all get the exact partner you wanted?"}, {"start": 470.24, "end": 471.0, "text": "That's right."}, {"start": 471.0, "end": 474.24, "text": "It's totally not fair that we saddled Pierce with Todd."}, {"start": 474.24, "end": 475.84, "text": "We should probably choose partners again."}, {"start": 475.84, "end": 477.16, "text": "I mean, just to be fair."}, {"start": 477.16, "end": 478.0, "text": "So it's agreed."}, {"start": 478.0, "end": 480.16, "text": "Let's go to the study room and deal with this Todd problem"}, {"start": 480.16, "end": 480.92, "text": "once and for all."}, {"start": 480.92, "end": 483.48, "text": "OK."}, {"start": 483.48, "end": 485.76, "text": "Oh, did you want me to come?"}, {"start": 485.76, "end": 487.44, "text": "It's called the Todd problem."}, {"start": 489.48, "end": 492.24, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 496.68, "end": 499.88, "text": "- Okay, we just have to come up with a fair way"}, {"start": 499.88, "end": 504.08, "text": "to decide who is going to be stuck for an entire semester"}, {"start": 504.08, "end": 509.08, "text": "with this random, this non-grouper."}, {"start": 509.7, "end": 510.64, "text": "No offense, Todd."}, {"start": 510.64, "end": 511.6, "text": "- None taken."}, {"start": 511.6, "end": 513.24, "text": "I'm happy to work with whoever."}, {"start": 513.24, "end": 515.48, "text": "- There's only one way to decide this fairly."}, {"start": 515.48, "end": 517.56, "text": "We go boy, girl, boy, girl."}, {"start": 517.56, "end": 519.44, "text": "But everyone has to have a different hair color."}, {"start": 519.44, "end": 523.56, "text": "and be from a different high school and be a different race."}, {"start": 523.56, "end": 526.2, "text": "I guess I'd be with Britta."}, {"start": 526.2, "end": 527.64, "text": "I guess my hands are tied."}, {"start": 527.64, "end": 528.54, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 528.54, "end": 529.74, "text": "The hair color concept intrigues me because it's"}, {"start": 529.74, "end": 530.88, "text": "how I distinguish you anyway."}, {"start": 530.88, "end": 532.24, "text": "But what if we arranged by age so that way"}, {"start": 532.24, "end": 533.88, "text": "the young people can work while the old people sleep"}, {"start": 533.88, "end": 534.8, "text": "and vice versa?"}, {"start": 534.8, "end": 536.64, "text": "I was just wondering who you considered old"}, {"start": 536.64, "end": 539.08, "text": "because I'd like to remind you again"}, {"start": 539.08, "end": 541.16, "text": "that I'm just about the same age as Jeff."}, {"start": 541.16, "end": 542.16, "text": "Well, I was counting Jeff as old too."}, {"start": 542.16, "end": 543.06, "text": "Hey."}, {"start": 543.06, "end": 544.2, "text": "Oh, well, that's all right then."}, {"start": 544.2, "end": 547.2, "text": "I just don't understand how my age has anything to do--"}, {"start": 547.2, "end": 549.24, "text": "oh, for heaven's sake, Pierce."}, {"start": 549.24, "end": 551.32, "text": "I was thinking the thing that would be most beneficial,"}, {"start": 551.32, "end": 553.68, "text": "you know, for the group, would be to pair the people"}, {"start": 553.68, "end": 556.08, "text": "with the lowest GPAs with the highest."}, {"start": 556.08, "end": 557.62, "text": "Hmm, interesting."}, {"start": 557.62, "end": 559.66, "text": "The highest carrying the lowest."}, {"start": 559.66, "end": 561.28, "text": "I can see how you might want that."}, {"start": 561.28, "end": 562.72, "text": "You know what, Annie?"}, {"start": 562.72, "end": 565.12, "text": "Pew, pew, pew, pew."}, {"start": 565.12, "end": 565.96, "text": "Wait, no."}, {"start": 565.96, "end": 567.92, "text": "Pew, pew, pew."}, {"start": 567.92, "end": 568.84, "text": "Wait."}, {"start": 568.84, "end": 570.44, "text": "Does anyone else have kids?"}, {"start": 570.44, "end": 572.88, "text": "Because I have a gorgeous little newborn"}, {"start": 572.88, "end": 573.8, "text": "that I like to get--"}, {"start": 573.8, "end": 574.7, "text": "Oh, perfect."}, {"start": 574.7, "end": 576.2, "text": "You'll enjoy talking to Shirley about her kids."}, {"start": 576.2, "end": 579.08, "text": "Uh-uh, don't go trying to pawn Todd off on me."}, {"start": 579.08, "end": 580.34, "text": "Again, none taken."}, {"start": 580.34, "end": 583.08, "text": "Guys, our terrariums are due tomorrow, and it's already nine."}, {"start": 583.08, "end": 585.72, "text": "Okay, let's make this simple and do it like student housing."}, {"start": 585.72, "end": 589.02, "text": "Everyone write down their lab partner preferences from one to eight."}, {"start": 589.02, "end": 590.68, "text": "Abed, you're a computer."}, {"start": 590.68, "end": 593.06, "text": "You figure out a way to put us in our optimal pairings."}, {"start": 593.06, "end": 596.02, "text": "And before you all go putting Todd down last,"}, {"start": 596.02, "end": 598.4, "text": "don't forget he comes with a turtle."}, {"start": 598.4, "end": 599.8, "text": "You're halfway done."}, {"start": 599.8, "end": 600.86, "text": "How does that sound?"}, {"start": 600.86, "end": 603.16, "text": "[snoring]"}, {"start": 603.16, "end": 604.34, "text": "Somebody wake up, Pierce."}, {"start": 604.34, "end": 606.24, "text": "Hello, Arizona Matchbook Company."}, {"start": 606.24, "end": 607.7, "text": "I had to get some answers,"}, {"start": 607.7, "end": 610.94, "text": "And I needed answers like a fish needs a bicycle. A lot."}, {"start": 610.94, "end": 612.64, "text": "Uh, hello? Hello?"}, {"start": 612.64, "end": 614.98, "text": "Yeah, I am interested in your matchbooks."}, {"start": 614.98, "end": 616.34, "text": "Would you like to place an order?"}, {"start": 616.34, "end": 617.54, "text": "I had to think fast."}, {"start": 619.04, "end": 619.88, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 619.88, "end": 620.98, "text": "Get away from my desk."}, {"start": 620.98, "end": 622.12, "text": "I'll call you back."}, {"start": 622.12, "end": 623.82, "text": "You've been walking around campus asking people"}, {"start": 623.82, "end": 625.56, "text": "weird questions and then staring at them"}, {"start": 625.56, "end": 627.16, "text": "while slightly moving your lips?"}, {"start": 627.16, "end": 628.46, "text": "I had to think fast."}, {"start": 628.46, "end": 629.6, "text": "No."}, {"start": 629.6, "end": 630.42, "text": "Ben."}, {"start": 631.66, "end": 634.1, "text": "I think this job might be getting to you."}, {"start": 634.1, "end": 636.34, "text": "I think you need to take some time off."}, {"start": 636.34, "end": 638.08, "text": "You'd like that, wouldn't you?"}, {"start": 638.08, "end": 640.34, "text": "Very much so."}, {"start": 640.34, "end": 641.62, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 641.62, "end": 642.78, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 642.78, "end": 643.18, "text": "Yep."}, {"start": 643.18, "end": 645.18, "text": "According to my system, Andy's going to be with Shirley."}, {"start": 645.18, "end": 647.94, "text": "Pierce is with me, Troy's with Britta, and Jeff is with Todd."}, {"start": 647.94, "end": 650.1, "text": "OK, let's get to work."}, {"start": 650.1, "end": 653.94, "text": "Wait, how did I end up with Todd?"}, {"start": 653.94, "end": 656.26, "text": "No offense, but he wasn't exactly at the top of my list."}, {"start": 656.26, "end": 656.98, "text": "None taken."}, {"start": 656.98, "end": 658.06, "text": "It's what the algorithm dictated."}, {"start": 658.06, "end": 659.5, "text": "And we're just supposed to trust your algorithm."}, {"start": 659.5, "end": 660.46, "text": "You're questioning my algorithm?"}, {"start": 660.46, "end": 661.3, "text": "Not necessarily."}, {"start": 661.3, "end": 662.62, "text": "Is your algorithm above questioning?"}, {"start": 662.62, "end": 663.3, "text": "Not necessarily."}, {"start": 663.3, "end": 664.86, "text": "Will you just tell us how you chose?"}, {"start": 664.86, "end": 666.44, "text": "I used the balance to rank everyone by popularity,"}, {"start": 666.44, "end": 668.32, "text": "and I put the most popular with the least popular."}, {"start": 668.32, "end": 670.4, "text": "I figured it would maximize each partnership's audience appeal."}, {"start": 670.4, "end": 671.64, "text": "Oh, I see."}, {"start": 671.64, "end": 673.6, "text": "So I was number one, and he was obviously number eight."}, {"start": 673.6, "end": 674.5, "text": "No offense taught."}, {"start": 674.5, "end": 676.8, "text": "You and Todd were four and five."}, {"start": 676.8, "end": 677.7, "text": "I was four?"}, {"start": 677.7, "end": 678.6, "text": "Todd was four."}, {"start": 678.6, "end": 679.5, "text": "I was five?"}, {"start": 679.5, "end": 680.4, "text": "Well, that's insane."}, {"start": 680.4, "end": 681.56, "text": "We don't even know him."}, {"start": 681.56, "end": 682.6, "text": "He's a stranger."}, {"start": 682.6, "end": 683.7, "text": "Jeez, Jeff."}, {"start": 683.7, "end": 685.12, "text": "It has feelings."}, {"start": 685.12, "end": 687.32, "text": "Wait, so we all know Annie was number one"}, {"start": 687.32, "end": 689.8, "text": "because she'd do all the work."}, {"start": 689.8, "end": 692.8, "text": "And Shirley was her partner, so--"}, {"start": 692.8, "end": 693.68, "text": "What that means?"}, {"start": 693.68, "end": 695.68, "text": "I just worked it out."}, {"start": 695.68, "end": 698.68, "text": "I'm more popular than someone."}, {"start": 698.68, "end": 700.68, "text": "♪♪♪"}, {"start": 700.68, "end": 703.68, "text": "Getting the Mashbook shipped to me the same day wasn't easy."}, {"start": 703.68, "end": 705.68, "text": "I had to pay the company money."}, {"start": 705.68, "end": 707.68, "text": "I used Nunez's card."}, {"start": 707.68, "end": 709.68, "text": "He thanked me at the Detective Awards."}, {"start": 709.68, "end": 714.68, "text": "Somewhere, somehow, I was gonna find what I was looking for."}, {"start": 714.68, "end": 716.68, "text": "[ Horn honks ]"}, {"start": 716.68, "end": 720.68, "text": "♪♪♪"}, {"start": 720.68, "end": 723.26, "text": "(horn honking)"}, {"start": 730.84, "end": 733.36, "text": "- Mary, mother of God."}, {"start": 733.36, "end": 734.76, "text": "Was I crazy?"}, {"start": 734.76, "end": 736.62, "text": "Or was I on the verge of something?"}, {"start": 736.62, "end": 740.3, "text": "My mind reeled with thoughts, voices, standup premises."}, {"start": 740.3, "end": 742.2, "text": "Why don't they just make tires out of pavement"}, {"start": 742.2, "end": 743.36, "text": "so you can drive on anything?"}, {"start": 743.36, "end": 744.2, "text": "- What's up with buttons?"}, {"start": 744.2, "end": 746.6, "text": "- What would happen if Nicholson was a gynecologist?"}, {"start": 746.6, "end": 747.6, "text": "(chuckling)"}, {"start": 747.6, "end": 749.04, "text": "There was something there."}, {"start": 749.04, "end": 750.16, "text": "I need a notepad."}, {"start": 750.68, "end": 751.68, "text": "Maybe a blazer."}, {"start": 755.48, "end": 757.82, "text": "Honey, I... I don't know when I'll be home."}, {"start": 758.12, "end": 760.62, "text": "How could you guys hate me more than Pierce?"}, {"start": 760.96, "end": 762.62, "text": "Or anything more than Pierce?"}, {"start": 762.62, "end": 763.8, "text": "Thin eyes, Shirley."}, {"start": 763.96, "end": 767.3, "text": "My friends and I are not gonna let you drive a wedge between us."}, {"start": 767.3, "end": 768.66, "text": "Shirley has a point."}, {"start": 768.8, "end": 771.4, "text": "This list stinks like a butt convention."}, {"start": 771.5, "end": 774.04, "text": "How else could you explain Troy being so unpopular?"}, {"start": 774.2, "end": 777.3, "text": "Uh, I think I was the popular one in our pairing."}, {"start": 777.58, "end": 778.7, "text": "Oh, Troy."}, {"start": 780.68, "end": 782.68, "text": "Fine, why don't I just go work with Todd?"}, {"start": 782.68, "end": 784.68, "text": "Hey, hey, that's cool."}, {"start": 784.68, "end": 786.68, "text": "Whatever gets this project done."}, {"start": 786.68, "end": 788.68, "text": "Oh, wow. What a great guy."}, {"start": 788.68, "end": 790.68, "text": "I can see why all of you like him so much more than me."}, {"start": 790.68, "end": 794.68, "text": "Jeff, maybe it's just that no one wants to carry you all year."}, {"start": 794.68, "end": 797.68, "text": "Gee, you're right, Annie. It's not personal."}, {"start": 797.68, "end": 799.68, "text": "I mean, it's not like people really like you."}, {"start": 799.68, "end": 801.68, "text": "You're just a good grade in a tight sweater."}, {"start": 801.68, "end": 803.68, "text": "You're just a bad grade in a tight sweater."}, {"start": 803.68, "end": 805.68, "text": "And who the hell are you always texting?"}, {"start": 805.68, "end": 806.68, "text": "Everyone you know is here."}, {"start": 806.68, "end": 808.68, "text": "Okay, let's all just take a breath."}, {"start": 808.68, "end": 810.68, "text": "Okay, let's all just take a breath."}, {"start": 810.68, "end": 812.68, "text": "Don't get your number four stink on this, Todd."}, {"start": 812.68, "end": 814.18, "text": "Okay, let's focus."}, {"start": 814.18, "end": 818.68, "text": "We're all the same people we were 12 hours ago."}, {"start": 818.68, "end": 820.68, "text": "Maybe we should just revert to our original pairings."}, {"start": 820.68, "end": 822.18, "text": "But I thought you didn't want to carry Jeff."}, {"start": 822.18, "end": 824.18, "text": "Oh, well, you just don't want to work with Shirley."}, {"start": 824.18, "end": 826.68, "text": "You too, Brute."}, {"start": 826.68, "end": 829.18, "text": "It's just... you're a creationist."}, {"start": 829.18, "end": 830.18, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 830.18, "end": 831.18, "text": "You're so religious."}, {"start": 831.18, "end": 833.18, "text": "How are you gonna do science experiments"}, {"start": 833.18, "end": 834.68, "text": "if you don't even believe in science?"}, {"start": 834.68, "end": 836.18, "text": "Just because someone's religious"}, {"start": 836.18, "end": 838.18, "text": "doesn't mean they have a problem with science."}, {"start": 838.18, "end": 840.98, "text": "And certainly if an introductory biology course"}, {"start": 840.98, "end": 844.48, "text": "at a community college can refute 2,000 years of miracles--"}, {"start": 844.48, "end": 845.78, "text": "Oh, God!"}, {"start": 845.78, "end": 846.78, "text": "And what about Britta?"}, {"start": 846.78, "end": 848.28, "text": "She's not gonna dissect anything."}, {"start": 848.28, "end": 849.28, "text": "Fine, you got me."}, {"start": 849.28, "end": 851.28, "text": "I won't dissect anything with a face."}, {"start": 851.28, "end": 852.78, "text": "What about worms?"}, {"start": 852.78, "end": 854.58, "text": "They have tiny little faces."}, {"start": 854.58, "end": 855.98, "text": "This is why you're the stupidest!"}, {"start": 855.98, "end": 858.88, "text": "If loving worms is stupid, I don't want to be smart."}, {"start": 858.88, "end": 859.88, "text": "It is!"}, {"start": 859.88, "end": 861.38, "text": "And you can't be!"}, {"start": 861.38, "end": 863.58, "text": "Guys, I just figured it all out."}, {"start": 863.58, "end": 865.58, "text": "Pierce, wake up. Jeff is gonna heal us."}, {"start": 865.58, "end": 867.98, "text": "We have been looking at this totally wrong."}, {"start": 867.98, "end": 870.82, "text": "There's no way I'm unpopular."}, {"start": 870.82, "end": 873.02, "text": "One of you monsters just put me last"}, {"start": 873.02, "end": 875.02, "text": "in a petty attempt to humble me."}, {"start": 875.02, "end": 876.52, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 876.52, "end": 880.06, "text": "I just had a terrible nightmare that Jeff was a pompous ass."}, {"start": 880.06, "end": 881.82, "text": "Also, Todd was there."}, {"start": 881.82, "end": 883.52, "text": "Uh, no offense, Todd."}, {"start": 892.24, "end": 894.6, "text": "I poked my nose where it didn't belong."}, {"start": 894.6, "end": 898.8, "text": "Someone or something had sent me a message."}, {"start": 900.3, "end": 904.1, "text": "Veronica, it's my fault she got mixed up in all this."}, {"start": 904.1, "end": 905.6, "text": "(gasps)"}, {"start": 905.6, "end": 907.6, "text": "(overlapping chatter)"}, {"start": 907.6, "end": 909.44, "text": "- Ah, Todd?"}, {"start": 909.44, "end": 911.44, "text": "- I'm pretty sure I heard a fire alarm."}, {"start": 911.44, "end": 913.1, "text": "- Nobody's going home until we see those ballots."}, {"start": 913.1, "end": 915.1, "text": "- See the ballots? Are you crazy?"}, {"start": 915.1, "end": 917.44, "text": "- I say, let's lay our cards on the table"}, {"start": 917.44, "end": 919.7, "text": "and see what everyone really thinks of each other."}, {"start": 919.7, "end": 921.44, "text": "- Get behind me, Abbot."}, {"start": 921.44, "end": 922.74, "text": "(screams)"}, {"start": 922.74, "end": 924.24, "text": "- Jack, stop it!"}, {"start": 924.24, "end": 926.24, "text": "Get back! Get back!"}, {"start": 926.24, "end": 928.24, "text": "I'm doing this for all of us."}, {"start": 928.24, "end": 930.24, "text": "Oh, no, she's got her marijuana lighter!"}, {"start": 930.24, "end": 932.24, "text": "Don't!"}, {"start": 932.24, "end": 935.24, "text": "No! The turtle is in there!"}, {"start": 935.24, "end": 938.24, "text": "Oh, my God! I'm so sorry!"}, {"start": 938.24, "end": 941.24, "text": "What is wrong with you people?"}, {"start": 941.24, "end": 944.24, "text": "Huh?"}, {"start": 944.24, "end": 947.24, "text": "I thought you were supposed to be friends!"}, {"start": 947.24, "end": 951.24, "text": "I thought you were supposed to love each other!"}, {"start": 951.24, "end": 961.92, "text": "other. Your love is weird and toxic and it destroys everything it touches. I no"}, {"start": 961.92, "end": 969.24, "text": "longer care about grades or biology or finally graduating from college like I"}, {"start": 969.24, "end": 977.96, "text": "promised my dying father. I'm going home. I'm gonna hold my wife and my child"}, {"start": 977.96, "end": 982.2, "text": "and I am gonna finally take my insulin shot!"}, {"start": 984.0, "end": 985.5, "text": "A fence takin'!"}, {"start": 988.8, "end": 990.0, "text": "A fence takin'!"}, {"start": 995.64, "end": 997.84, "text": "- Well, he is right about one thing."}, {"start": 997.84, "end": 999.68, "text": "You're all terrible people."}, {"start": 999.68, "end": 1002.84, "text": "And I don't care about the stupidest Simon, I'm going home."}, {"start": 1002.84, "end": 1005.18, "text": "(upbeat music)"}, {"start": 1005.18, "end": 1006.02, "text": "No, I'm not."}, {"start": 1006.02, "end": 1007.62, "text": "- I'm not going to biology class."}, {"start": 1007.62, "end": 1009.42, "text": "It starts in 15 minutes."}, {"start": 1009.42, "end": 1011.42, "text": "(gasps)"}, {"start": 1013.42, "end": 1015.5, "text": "- And eventually this caterpillar"}, {"start": 1015.5, "end": 1018.42, "text": "will come out of its cocoon and then,"}, {"start": 1018.42, "end": 1019.26, "text": "pop, pop!"}, {"start": 1020.16, "end": 1023.1, "text": "(cheering)"}, {"start": 1023.1, "end": 1024.1, "text": "- Nice work, you two."}, {"start": 1025.3, "end": 1027.9, "text": "You know they're laughing at you, right?"}, {"start": 1027.9, "end": 1029.1, "text": "I mean, that's my theory."}, {"start": 1030.64, "end": 1032.24, "text": "Now, super group,"}, {"start": 1033.44, "end": 1035.84, "text": "I can't help but notice the sorry lack of terrariums."}, {"start": 1035.84, "end": 1037.26, "text": "We didn't have time to finish."}, {"start": 1037.26, "end": 1039.12, "text": "Here's mine."}, {"start": 1039.12, "end": 1040.96, "text": "When did you even have time to do that?"}, {"start": 1040.96, "end": 1042.18, "text": "You're pathological."}, {"start": 1042.18, "end": 1043.64, "text": "It's too late for flattery."}, {"start": 1043.64, "end": 1046.56, "text": "Professor, obviously, this isn't working out."}, {"start": 1046.56, "end": 1048.14, "text": "You're just going to have to put us with our original lab"}, {"start": 1048.14, "end": 1049.12, "text": "partners, all right?"}, {"start": 1049.12, "end": 1051.32, "text": "I don't have to do anything."}, {"start": 1051.32, "end": 1053.08, "text": "Not after you broke my boy, Todd."}, {"start": 1053.08, "end": 1055.2, "text": "That man called me crying this morning."}, {"start": 1055.2, "end": 1057.12, "text": "You know he fought in Iraq, right?"}, {"start": 1057.12, "end": 1060.0, "text": "We had a name for people like you in prison."}, {"start": 1060.0, "end": 1062.92, "text": "We called you the mean clique."}, {"start": 1062.92, "end": 1064.78, "text": "But I have a solution."}, {"start": 1064.78, "end": 1067.78, "text": "All seven of you will share a microscope, one bench,"}, {"start": 1067.78, "end": 1069.7, "text": "and one grade that I will average."}, {"start": 1069.7, "end": 1071.38, "text": "Everyone else gets their own stuff."}, {"start": 1071.38, "end": 1073.58, "text": "So can we get an extension on the first assignment?"}, {"start": 1073.58, "end": 1074.48, "text": "No."}, {"start": 1074.48, "end": 1075.38, "text": "You all fail."}, {"start": 1075.38, "end": 1077.3, "text": "[DOOR SLAMS]"}, {"start": 1077.3, "end": 1078.22, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 1078.22, "end": 1079.18, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 1079.18, "end": 1081.82, "text": "Oh my god."}, {"start": 1081.82, "end": 1083.3, "text": "How did this happen?"}, {"start": 1083.3, "end": 1084.94, "text": "And did I miss the fireman?"}, {"start": 1084.94, "end": 1087.3, "text": "Dean, the explanation is simple."}, {"start": 1087.3, "end": 1089.3, "text": "It's all connected."}, {"start": 1089.3, "end": 1091.9, "text": "A web of conspiracy that goes all the way"}, {"start": 1091.9, "end": 1094.34, "text": "to the top of Arizona."}, {"start": 1094.34, "end": 1097.04, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 1097.04, "end": 1100.1, "text": "Jay, somebody's been squatting in the utility closet."}, {"start": 1100.1, "end": 1103.46, "text": "There's a hot plate back there, thousands of matches."}, {"start": 1103.46, "end": 1107.14, "text": "I mean, we're looking at dozens of major health and fire"}, {"start": 1107.14, "end": 1110.3, "text": "code violations."}, {"start": 1110.3, "end": 1112.74, "text": "I think we're going to have to get the police involved."}, {"start": 1112.74, "end": 1114.62, "text": "And that's when it hit me."}, {"start": 1114.62, "end": 1117.5, "text": "I was in really big trouble."}, {"start": 1117.5, "end": 1119.42, "text": "[NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]"}, {"start": 1119.42, "end": 1121.38, "text": "[NON-ENGLISH SPEECH]"}, {"start": 1121.38, "end": 1123.08, "text": "No."}, {"start": 1123.08, "end": 1126.92, "text": "No need to get the cops with a conspiracy this big."}, {"start": 1126.92, "end": 1129.08, "text": "They're probably involved."}, {"start": 1129.08, "end": 1129.98, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 1129.98, "end": 1133.12, "text": "What Chang says makes a lot of sense and--"}, {"start": 1133.12, "end": 1135.12, "text": "OK, you know what?"}, {"start": 1135.12, "end": 1136.08, "text": "I quit."}, {"start": 1136.08, "end": 1138.44, "text": "I mean, I can deal with the not getting paid,"}, {"start": 1138.44, "end": 1141.96, "text": "but I draw the line at you enabling this man."}, {"start": 1141.96, "end": 1145.8, "text": "I mean, I'm seriously concerned that he's mentally ill."}, {"start": 1145.8, "end": 1147.4, "text": "And it's not funny at all."}, {"start": 1147.4, "end": 1148.32, "text": "It's scary."}, {"start": 1148.32, "end": 1149.16, "text": "The top of the original--"}, {"start": 1149.16, "end": 1150.08, "text": "I needed to know more about the--"}, {"start": 1150.08, "end": 1151.16, "text": "Was it a very high mesa?"}, {"start": 1151.16, "end": 1151.96, "text": "Were they ethnically distant?"}, {"start": 1151.96, "end": 1153.72, "text": "- You guys didn't mind. - Did they bring it down?"}, {"start": 1153.72, "end": 1156.76, "text": "- Either way, I was good at it. - Could I buy a calendar?"}, {"start": 1156.76, "end": 1159.06, "text": "Okay, screw this. I quit."}, {"start": 1162.16, "end": 1163.0, "text": "- Hmm?"}, {"start": 1164.12, "end": 1167.32, "text": "Well, it seems that Greendale owes you a debt of gratitude."}, {"start": 1167.32, "end": 1170.4, "text": "How would you like to be the new out of security?"}, {"start": 1170.4, "end": 1171.52, "text": "- I had to think fast."}, {"start": 1171.52, "end": 1173.04, "text": "- Yes."}, {"start": 1173.04, "end": 1174.52, "text": "- I don't know."}, {"start": 1174.52, "end": 1178.72, "text": "Was I crazy or was I just doing right by the school?"}, {"start": 1178.72, "end": 1180.96, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 1181.96, "end": 1184.22, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 1186.62, "end": 1188.12, "text": "- Just easy move."}, {"start": 1188.12, "end": 1189.16, "text": "- I'll get in here."}, {"start": 1189.16, "end": 1190.6, "text": "- Just share."}, {"start": 1190.6, "end": 1192.6, "text": "- This is awkward, isn't it?"}, {"start": 1192.6, "end": 1194.8, "text": "You know, I think it's pretty clear what destroyed"}, {"start": 1194.8, "end": 1197.1, "text": "the balance in our study group's ecosystem."}, {"start": 1197.1, "end": 1198.8, "text": "- Ranking one person above another."}, {"start": 1198.8, "end": 1200.7, "text": "- But the difference is you get the best of us."}, {"start": 1200.7, "end": 1201.74, "text": "- Racism?"}, {"start": 1201.74, "end": 1203.18, "text": "- No."}, {"start": 1203.18, "end": 1204.0, "text": "Todd."}, {"start": 1205.18, "end": 1206.18, "text": "- Todd?"}, {"start": 1206.18, "end": 1207.34, "text": "- Yes, Todd."}, {"start": 1207.34, "end": 1208.72, "text": "- You sure they're ahead on that guy?"}, {"start": 1208.72, "end": 1210.14, "text": "- None taken."}, {"start": 1210.14, "end": 1211.32, "text": "What's wrong with him?"}, {"start": 1211.32, "end": 1213.32, "text": "I had to be un-Christian, but that boy's sad."}, {"start": 1213.32, "end": 1215.32, "text": "I missed this."}, {"start": 1215.32, "end": 1217.32, "text": "And it's dumb, baby."}, {"start": 1217.32, "end": 1219.32, "text": "Shut up."}, {"start": 1219.32, "end": 1221.32, "text": "Change your own diaper."}, {"start": 1221.32, "end": 1223.32, "text": "[chatter]"}, {"start": 1239.32, "end": 1241.32, "text": "These questions are really personal."}, {"start": 1241.4, "end": 1242.7, "text": "Are you sure this is anonymous?"}, {"start": 1242.78, "end": 1245.7, "text": "Yeah, they're just practice evaluations for my psych class."}, {"start": 1247.82, "end": 1250.04, "text": "- All right, who did a butt? - They're boobs."}, {"start": 1250.7, "end": 1252.54, "text": "- And I don't know. - Take it again."}, {"start": 1253.12, "end": 1254.12, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 1254.5, "end": 1255.62, "text": "Somebody drew a penis."}, {"start": 1255.7, "end": 1257.92, "text": "Oh, and another penis."}, {"start": 1258.0, "end": 1260.34, "text": "Penis, penis, penis."}, {"start": 1260.42, "end": 1262.64, "text": "- Very mature, guys. - I didn't draw a penis."}, {"start": 1262.72, "end": 1263.72, "text": "Me neither."}, {"start": 1265.76, "end": 1267.76, "text": "Yeah, these are all normally filled out tests."}, {"start": 1268.84, "end": 1270.84, "text": "Ha ha, gotcha!"}, {"start": 1270.84, "end": 1273.84, "text": "This was also a test and you all peniced."}, {"start": 1273.84, "end": 1275.84, "text": "Passed."}, {"start": 1275.84, "end": 1277.84, "text": "Maybe I need to take one."}, {"start": 1277.84, "end": 1279.84, "text": "A test, not a penis."}]}